  "description": "UV-projection resampling of authored bitmaps (04-layer-stack-and-compositing.md section 4): UV transform convention and the BilinearHQ, BilinearSharp and Nearest filters with Repeat and RepeatNone wrapping, fitted on the Tier 0 golden resample-uv.",
